{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10531","headline":"陪窦侍御灵云南亭宴诗得雷字 · 高适","name":"陪窦侍御灵云南亭宴诗得雷字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人幽宜眺听，目极喜亭台。\n风景知愁在，关山忆梦回。\n秪言殊语默，何意忝游陪。\n连唱波澜动，冥搜物象开。\n新秋归远树，残雨拥轻雷。\n檐外长天尽，尊前独鸟来。\n常吟塞下曲，多谢幕中才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}